Compressed pink and purple medals pay 100 and 200. Larger golden medals scale by ten times plus 7 (7,777 then 77,777, and so on). Rare medals play a sound when they appear.

Green Win pays green medals (5 each) instead of ordinary medals. Rare medals still roll as usual during that payout.

=== Sherbi Balls ===

Roulette BALL results and several other effects spawn Sherbi Balls. About half are Normal. The rest are Special or Rare. When a ball's effect spawns another ball, the new ball carries a chain number. Effects are about twice as strong at 10 chains, then rise more slowly.

A ball that continues shows a Continue popup and the chain count on its face.

