Costs are abbreviated: K for thousand, M for million, B for billion, T for trillion. Level 0 is 4.0/s insertion, no SP or ball insertion, 30% special-ball chance, 50% roulette win rate, 10,000 insertions or 1/25,000 for Paletta, and 5 seconds of leftover speed. Faster Insertion multiplies a 4.0/s base. Refined Roulette values are win rate (100% minus LOSE). More Paletta Ball lists guaranteed insertions and the instant-spawn chance. Item-pocket and Ferretta-item values are pocket/item weights at that level.

=== Totems ===

Totems unlock at 1,000,000,000 total, on the second-floor shrine. Spending the saved total at the offering box summons a totem. Summoned totems save. An effect applies only after the totem is placed on an altar. Extra altars cost 0, then 1.5 billion, 5 billion, 200 billion, and 5 trillion. Unplaced totems can be respawned from the shrine.

Summon cost is 1 billion, 10 billion, or 100 billion depending on the totem. Summons are random within the current cost tier, except that Orange is always the first totem; the next tier opens once a tier is complete.<ref name="cwiki-totem">[https://wikiwiki.jp/vr_bigpusher/%E3%81%A7%E3%81%8B%E3%83%97%E7%A5%9E%E7%A4%BE でかプ神社＆トーテム] (in Japanese). クソでっけぇプッシャーゲーム Wiki. Retrieved {{Date|September 3, 2026}}.</ref>

